{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 0, "text": "《雾港》", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 1, "text": "人物小传", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 2, "text": "林砚：男，刑警，三十岁，沉默寡言。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 3, "text": "苏晚：女，法医，二十八岁，观察力极强。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 4, "text": "周叙：男，码头调度，三十五岁，谨小慎微。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 5, "text": "陈默：男，港区保安，四十岁，寡言少语。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 6, "text": "顾姨：女，老住户，六十岁，嘴硬心软。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 7, "text": "术语：缆桩 = 码头系船柱；防波堤 = 港湾外侧挡浪结构。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 8, "text": "分集大纲", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 9, "text": "· 01 雾夜发现异常血迹", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 10, "text": "· 05 暗流浮出旧案线人", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 11, "text": "· 10 家宴牵出祭祀旧俗", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 12, "text": "· 12 潮汐表与货运记录矛盾", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 13, "text": "· 18 旁观者提供关键证词", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 14, "text": "· 20 归港后真相揭晓", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 15, "text": "第1集《雾港》", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 16, "text": "Episode 1: \"Mist Harbor\"", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 17, "text": "1-1 夜 外 港区码头", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 18, "text": "人物：林砚 苏晚", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 19, "text": "【人物站位】林砚靠门侧，周叙在桌后，桌灯压到画右下", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 20, "text": "△ 雨点砸在铁皮棚顶，声音一下比一下沉。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 21, "text": "林砚（对白，声线压低）：这雾不对。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 22, "text": "LIN YAN (DIALOGUE, voice low): Stay close to me. That name is on the list.", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 23, "text": "△ 监控屏幕泛着冷蓝，画面停在三点整。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 24, "text": "林砚（VO，气声）：雾里有人在等。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 25, "text": "LIN YAN (VO, voice tight): The fog is wrong. The door was locked from inside.", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 26, "text": "△ 值班桌上的茶已经凉了，杯壁凝着水。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 27, "text": "林砚（对白，尾音收住）：调昨晚三点的监控。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 28, "text": "LIN YAN (DIALOGUE, tail held back): We have three hours. That name is on the list.", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 29, "text": "△ 远处汽笛短促地响了一声，随后归于安静。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 30, "text": "苏晚（对白，喉音发紧）：我采过样了。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 31, "text": "SU WAN (DIALOGUE, voice low): This is not rust. The door was locked from inside.", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 32, "text": "△ 铁门被风推了一下，铰链发出细响。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 33, "text": "林砚（对白，声线压低）：先别碰。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 34, "text": "LIN YAN (DIALOGUE, breath short): Check the north gate. That name is on the list.", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 35, "text": "△ 苏晚把证物袋举到灯下，封口处有一道折痕。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 36, "text": "周叙（对白，气息短）：这个签字不是我。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 37, "text": "ZHOU XU (DIALOGUE, tail held back): The camera went dark. The door was locked from inside.", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 38, "text": "△ 码头路面湿滑，脚印在积水里断成两截。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 39, "text": "林砚（对白，尾音收住）：潮水要变了。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 40, "text": "LIN YAN (DIALOGUE, voice low): Keep the lamp low. That name is on the list.", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 41, "text": "△ 林砚停住脚步，视线落在缆桩边缘。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 42, "text": "1-2 夜 内 值班室", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 43, "text": "人物：林砚 苏晚", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 44, "text": "【音效】远处汽笛，低频压着雨声", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 45, "text": "△ 周叙把登记本合上，手指在封皮上停了一瞬。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 46, "text": "林砚（对白，喉音发紧）：这单子不对。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 47, "text": "LIN YAN (DIALOGUE, breath short): The seal was broken. The door was locked from inside.", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 48, "text": "△ 浓雾压着码头，货轮灯光在水面碎成一片抖动。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 49, "text": "林砚（对白，声线压低）：谁进的仓库。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 50, "text": "LIN YAN (DIALOGUE, tail held back): The manifest is wrong. That name is on the list.", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 51, "text": "△ 缆桩上有一道暗红痕迹，边缘已经发黑。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 52, "text": "苏晚（对白，气息短）：别碰证物袋。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 53, "text": "SU WAN (DIALOGUE, voice low): The manifest looks wrong. The door was locked from inside.", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 54, "text": "△ 手电光扫过仓库门缝，灰尘在光里浮动。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 55, "text": "林砚（对白，尾音收住）：你听见没有。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 56, "text": "LIN YAN (DIALOGUE, breath short): Look at the bollard. That name is on the list.", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 57, "text": "△ 雨点砸在铁皮棚顶，声音一下比一下沉。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 58, "text": "陈默（对白，喉音发紧）：灯一直亮着。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 59, "text": "CHEN MO (DIALOGUE, tail held back): Nobody leaves the dock. The door was locked from inside.", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 60, "text": "△ 监控屏幕泛着冷蓝，画面停在三点整。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 61, "text": "林砚（对白，声线压低）：把记录给我。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 62, "text": "LIN YAN (DIALOGUE, voice low): The radio is dead. That name is on the list.", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 63, "text": "△ 值班桌上的茶已经凉了，杯壁凝着水。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 64, "text": "1-3 夜 内 法医实验室", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 65, "text": "人物：林砚 周叙", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 66, "text": "【音效】雨声压在铁皮棚顶，偶尔有金属回响", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 67, "text": "△ 远处汽笛短促地响了一声，随后归于安静。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 68, "text": "林砚（对白，气息短）：这不是锈。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 69, "text": "LIN YAN (DIALOGUE, breath short): The water is rising. The door was locked from inside.", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 70, "text": "△ 铁门被风推了一下，铰链发出细响。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 71, "text": "林砚（对白，尾音收住）：走这边。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 72, "text": "LIN YAN (DIALOGUE, tail held back): Someone moved the crates. That name is on the list.", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 73, "text": "△ 苏晚把证物袋举到灯下，封口处有一道折痕。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 74, "text": "苏晚（对白，喉音发紧）：我采过样了。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 75, "text": "SU WAN (DIALOGUE, voice low): Nobody saw him leave. The door was locked from inside.", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 76, "text": "△ 码头路面湿滑，脚印在积水里断成两截。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 77, "text": "林砚（对白，声线压低）：锁是新换的。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 78, "text": "LIN YAN (DIALOGUE, breath short): Do not touch it. That name is on the list.", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 79, "text": "△ 林砚停住脚步，视线落在缆桩边缘。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 80, "text": "周叙（OS，声音压得很低）：我没有签字。", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 81, "text": "ZHOU XU (OS, barely audible): Stay close to me. The door was locked from inside.", "style": "", "heading": false}
{"file": "sample-20eps.docx", "idx": 82, "text": "△ 周叙把登记本合上，手指在封皮上停了一瞬。", "style": "", "heading": false}
